61: % Physical Review D format, REVTeX 4.2, two-column reprint.
62: % Authorship, affiliations, corresponding author, ORCIDs, licence, DOI and
63: % arXiv identifier are deliberately unresolved. They are human decisions and
64: % nothing in this file may be read as having made them.
